| **2** | Ban query syntax | `MODE #chan +b` | Emitted `472` (only bare `b` handled) | Returns `368 <nick> <chan> :End of Channel Ban List` | ✅ Fixed |
| **3** | Duplicate mode flags | `MODE #chan +ii` | Broadcasted `:Nick MODE #chan +ii` | Normalizes to `:Nick MODE #chan +i` in broadcast | ✅ Fixed |
| **4** | Net-zero / self-cancelling modes | `MODE #chan +t-t` | Broadcasted `:Nick MODE #chan +t-t` | Suppresses broadcast when net state change is empty | ✅ Fixed |
| **5** | Parameter starvation / skew | `MODE #chan +ko Bob` | Stole `Bob` as `+k` key; `+o` failed with `461` | Pre-validates parameter count; rejects with `461` | ✅ Fixed |
